<title>POLAND: ANIMEX FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>ANIMEX FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.09 vs   1.49</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.34 vs   1.27</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.65 vs   1.10</p>
<p> Sales		   45.58 vs  38.86</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.74 vs   2.88</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.25 vs   3.26</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.56 vs   3.10</p>
<p> Sales		   77.05 vs  68.85</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food trader and producer is</p>
<p>Animex SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
